Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始相信你说的神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begin to believe in your gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令他们坚守阵地 但他们逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ordered them to stand ground but they fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,您想让我受到怎样的惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What punishment would you have me inflict?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He took something from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要夺走他的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have something in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说错一个字 就等着受苦吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If errant word falls from mouth, only suffering will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She stands a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在只是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand nothing but a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我恢复理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will regain sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,失去理智的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is you who has no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.19,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死的叛徒 - 你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Fucking traitor. - Have you lost mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯是来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Castus came to aid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须确保剩下的人安全撤到山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must see all that remain to safety of the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 不要回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move quickly! And do not turn back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus is no fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.17,0:00:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他会在大风雪中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You expect him to wait in driven snow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等你到来 给他致命一击吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for you to arrive and announce his end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是我所期待的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is exactly what I expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,《必死无疑》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,清点下死者 看看损失了多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give count to those who have fallen! I would have number!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神逼着我们一路走向奥林匹斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods march us halfway to fucking Olympus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就为了往我们头上撒尿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only to piss on us from atop a wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到新的出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must make new attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要默不作声地当胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While we do not quit in silence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要发起震天动地的进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but march with thunder threating the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,拿脑袋去撞他们的墙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see old men strom their wall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最后一个女人和孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until last woman and child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,非叫它倒塌不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see it to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能冒这样的险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can not risk futher resource.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏就是要逼我们无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus has turning us from warming moves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,踏进他的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into his traps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而你会因愚蠢的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you would be slaughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,丢掉小命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in foolish action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想在山上找条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but seek path on this fucking Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏的军队从隘口那边过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus' army approaches from the mountain pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不能打仗的都撤到安全地方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move all those who cannot fight to safe distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的准备迎战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See the others to weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,让这个腰缠万贯的人瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will show the man forged of gold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想杀我们得付出什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the cost of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,用罗马人的血把他妈的雪地染红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see Roman blood upon fucking snow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,或者光荣战死 血洒白野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or our own in glorious death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都冷静下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话对打仗没好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your words move against purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得主动出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must press attack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,以免陷入被动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before his army washes over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没打算进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do not intend to advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神还给了你预言未来的能力吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods hold you privy to the future now, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是有过不幸的经历而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am but familiar with unfortunate past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在色雷斯时 曾在罗马辅备军中服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I served in the Roman auxiliary when I was yet of Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏的人马没有排出进攻阵形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus' men did not fall to battle formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们人数占绝对优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they hold advantage of numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不把我们一举消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why pause short of blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要等他们的将军来了才动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They but await their commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,军队在山上驻扎好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The legion takes position upon the ridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,正在按您的命令在前线安置大帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your praetorium to be set at forward position, as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了就迅速来报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break urgent word when it's prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲眼见证此次大胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would lay eyes upon war's end at nearest opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我有急事耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been delayed from appointed hour by pressing need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道您军务缠身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure you this much needed of you, upon victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How fares Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还在舔伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He yet licks his wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,或者这么说吧 花天酒地买安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or rather drops coin for more pleasing form to apply balming tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你不负使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for seeing duties to completion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有沉溺于私欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and not falling prey to baser desires of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,男人行乐要选对时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man must choose proper moment to seize pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而我唯您马首是瞻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine is forever entwined with your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听你这么说我很感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand moved by sentiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近的所作所为也让我很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I do by the way you've afforded yourself of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,您过奖了 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的言行值得褒奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor yourself in deed and action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你以这种心态迎接新的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see such spirit greet newest command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,全凭您吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak it, and see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让这个箱子从我面前消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish this chest spirited from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,任务虽然简单 却意义非凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A simple task, yet one of grave importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,应该把它放哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where shall I place it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打开看看 自己决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crack seal, and make own decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My armor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯时日无多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hour rushes to Spartacus' end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你继续代我行使权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have my Word and my Will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,再次与我并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}once more at my side upon final battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,父子齐上阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿与您同上战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would stand with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好好穿戴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself to proper dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,未来还有很多事需要商讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is much of our future to turn upon discussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你也是血肉之躯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You prove yourself yet mortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一点小伤不要在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A scratch, all but forgotten.{\r}
