Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴望用胜利和荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I yearn to honor the name of Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为克拉苏家族增光添彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with victory and laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不过等讨伐完叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet after rebellion is struck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要在这里扎根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall remain rooted firmly upon current ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不跟我们回罗马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not to return to Rome with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我奉命在希留爱沙为父亲操持大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will be tasked with securing my father's concerns within Sinuessa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等年龄到了再接过护民官的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I reach proper age for title of Tribune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很重要的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A duty of great import.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而你要留下来帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One you shall aid me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我要留在希留爱沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to remain in Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这座宅子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Within this very villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲可以让你当女管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father grants you title of vilica{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,监管所有伺候我的奴仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to oversee all who serve me beneath storied roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,同时在人生路上继续安抚我 指引我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to see comforting hand continue to guide me in life's journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我悬崖勒马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that drew me from edge of dire precipice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你太多 克芮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I owe you much, Kore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等我有了时间 我要好好补偿你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And soon I'll have the leisure of time to indulge repayment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,您的大帐已经设好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your praetorium stands ready upon the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,叫旗手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call for my standard bearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,晚饭准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have prepared afternoon meal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要吃的是叛贼的血肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have appetite towards bloodier repast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again, apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有些话我想跟您说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would also break needed words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有话快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, shatter them quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or see them to ground I once stood upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的要留在希留爱沙伺候提比略吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true I am to serve Tiberius in Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是他亲口跟你说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By his tongue did news fall upon ear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子转达我的话之前也不好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy carries my word yet spills it absent consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想在更私密的场合先跟你谈谈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had meant to share thought with you in more intimate fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要倾吐我的忧虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would share with you troubled mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,以及其缘由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and cause of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人整装待命 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All stands upon command, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只可惜时与愿违\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time conspires against will of the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等战斗胜利后我们再好好谈谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall break words again when battle is won,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时你就不会再忧伤流泪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will see tears evaporate beneath warming sun of deeper intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们到山里演一出戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, let us make show of presence upon ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让叛贼头子知道什么叫末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have the Rebel King know what doom falls upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏居然支起了看台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus erects pulvinus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像这儿是风雪竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as if we fight for his entertainment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以命相搏是为他取乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon snow of fucking arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那他将亲眼目睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he shall behold what miracles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,角斗士创造的鲜血奇观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of blood a gladiator is yet capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的好像所有人都是角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak as though all stand so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ways of us do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可都是我们亲手训练出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Passed on from our very hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可要面对夹击我们的大军 人数太少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too few to make difference against hordes we are pressed between.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯的信念没有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus is not wrong in his belief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一次次地完成了不可能的壮举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have done the impossible, time upon time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但靠的是战术 而不是蛮力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet by inspired tactic, not brute force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are the lay of your thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏占据绝对上风 因此过分大胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus has become overly bold by advantage he holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为了方便观赏预期的大胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He places his praetorium forward of proper position,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他的大帐放得过于靠前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to better view anticipated victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们应该去拜访他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps we should pay visit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他这一致命错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and explain fatal error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大帐安置得这么靠前 难道守军不会更多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does not closer position suggest heavier guard surrounding praetorium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,风暴到来之前 狂风会吹个没完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wind grows restless in advance of storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,待夜幕降临 只要去的人不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By night's fall, it shall serve as cloak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能神不知鬼不觉地摸进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if our number is not swollen beyond intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们之中的精锐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only the most skilled among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须像毒蛇一样发起攻击 又快又准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must strike as the serpent, fast and sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果克拉苏死在我们手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Crassus falls to our venom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他的军团将会群龙无首 成为一盘散沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his legions will froth and foam absent proper command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯时这招很管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A plan well served against Cossinius and Furius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,明明可以让他经历人间炼狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would send a sleeping man to the afterlife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你却要在睡梦中去抹他脖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he could awaken to a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人一起来 杀个痛快岂不更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sea of death as our entire army crashes upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这么庞大的阵容在行动之前就会被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such a force would be discovered in advance of purpose,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将优势尽失 连小孩子都能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and advantage lost. A thing a child could see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你当我是小孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would brand me as such?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是我失言了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words foolishly chosen, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,随我一道去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay by my side,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等克拉苏从这个世界消失后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when Crassus is falls from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他的大军也将很快烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall see his legions swiftly follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,注意观察 随时报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lay eyes and report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该在周围看守 以防有人逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall hold perimeter against escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的克拉苏今晚是无路可逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There shall be none for the mighty Crassus this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上刻的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is carved upon his flesh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Death is undeceivable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.06,0:22:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,撤回营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back to the camp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.73,0:22:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,逃吧 你们这些懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flee, you fucking coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,保持阵型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus slips from snare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有跟随他的一小撮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Along with a small clutch of his men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.41,0:23:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,让他吃点苦头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him feel the sting of his wounds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝聪明反被聪明误的滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and reflect upon the mind that inflicts them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把提比略和恺撒从睡梦中叫起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise Tiberius and Caesar from peaceful slumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阴谋诡计已经玩够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The time for ploy and deception draws to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你恺撒终于死而复生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar at last rises from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你也摆脱了惩罚的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you from specter of punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.85,0:24:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,凌晨时分叫醒我们有什么要紧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What draws concern in advance of morning sun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天一亮我就向米利亚峰进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I depart for Melia Ridge upon dawn's break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A move long in coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.24,0:24:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us hasten arrival{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.05,0:24:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你去集结希留爱沙城内的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have you pause to gather remaining troops yet in Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,到时你听提比略命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall to command beneath Tiberius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,月升之前与我会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and join me before moon greets us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不该是夺下希留爱沙的人带兵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should not the man who took Sinuessa lead them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.55,0:24:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么要剑都拿不稳的小子担此大任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a boy prone to losing his sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.89,0:24:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我对你的感激还不够多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You find my gratitude short in the coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,水涨船高的债钱是谁给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The abundant coin awarded to keep head above rising debts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁让梅泰勒斯去罗马宣扬你的英勇事迹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tales of bravery dispatched with Metellus to ply ears of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有专门为你开的庆功会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Celebration thrown in your honor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还是由这个你所不齿的人主持的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}presented by the man you disrespect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的慷慨我从未忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need no reminder of past generosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我仅仅只是提供建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I merely offer suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而我仅仅只是发号施令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I merely give command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而我刚才命令你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I commanded your placement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,守在城墙后面 听我的指示行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}behind city walls to move as my instrument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,夺下这座城的人是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I took this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.73,0:25:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,夺走斯巴达克斯性命的也会是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I shall take Spartacus' life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.91,0:25:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我身边的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with my son close at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那在这辉煌的荣耀中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where shall honored Caesar find himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒又居于何处呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the midst of such glories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.09,0:25:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一视同仁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At equal distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他别我行我素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he but removes himself from his own path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.15,0:25:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He falls to command, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay true to course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.69,0:25:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候少不了你的好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we shall seize the heavens as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们山上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall greet you upon the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,风卷残云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move with haste,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗜血杀敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thirst for enemy's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here we stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.88,0:25:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我官复原职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Title restored to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.06,0:25:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你又该卑躬屈膝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you beneath heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.51,0:26:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,走路当心 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mind your step, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很多巨人就因为太自大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many a giant has tumbled to the afterlife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,以为摔不死 结果一跟头去了黄泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}believing himself too big to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,召集军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Assemble the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.69,0:26:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.74,0:26:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这该死的屋子里就没人睡觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does no one ever sleep in this fucking house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.69,0:26:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到你们在争执 就过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was drawn by argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.59,0:26:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就躲在暗处偷看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you lurked in the shadow to witness it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.45,0:26:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,随着提比略官复要职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a dangerous thing to be removed from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要摆脱他们都是很危险的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since Tiberius is restored to imagined power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.77,0:27:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟敢说主人闲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You rattle tongue against your master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.55,0:27:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是悄悄说出我们共同的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but whisper of common threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.88,0:27:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能够消除我们共同的担忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And means of striking it from mutual concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.07,0:27:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,您愿意听我说 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for private audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这次谈话我必将守口如瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have it known that we break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.11,0:27:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还什么都没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They yet remain whole within fucking mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.19,0:27:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了我心情不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have witnessed foul mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.31,0:27:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可别再拐弯抹角 给我火上浇油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not deepen it with mystery and obscured purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.41,0:27:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,近来很多事情都变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much has changed of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.18,0:27:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我视同己出的那个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy that I once held to breast as a child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.78,0:27:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如今已经不再是当年的黄毛小子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has now grown far removed from the tenderness of youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.52,0:27:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的他 已经威胁到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thing he has become now threatens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.13,0:27:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你我所期望的前程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to turn us both from desired position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.62,0:27:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那小子究竟伤你多深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How deeply have you been pierced by the boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.18,0:27:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,您只用知道我受伤很深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must be enough to know that I stand wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.30,0:27:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,正如提比略官复原职给您造成的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you have been by Tiberius' return to exalted title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.68,0:27:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你有计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you have thought, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,目的就是抚平伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Towards dressing such grievous injuries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.04,0:28:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我很早就应该付诸行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that I should have birthed to action long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那就行动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.35,0:28:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不要把我恺撒牵扯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And leave Caesar far removed from plots and schemes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果剿灭斯巴达克斯有提比略的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If victory over Spartacus is shared with Tiberius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.59,0:28:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只怕他们父子之间再无嫌隙可乘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear their bond will be forged in permanence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,打开天窗说亮话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cut circle with straightest line,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你就说要我怎么做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and give voice to what you would have of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,知道你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It lifts heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.70,0:29:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是松了一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To know you are yet among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你救我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fate owed to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.30,0:29:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯说是你将我背回营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus tells of how you carried me upon back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.19,0:29:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,换了谁都会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is what any of us would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.65,0:29:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别的勇士受伤也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For another warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.66,0:29:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She yet requires rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她可以安心养伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will have it, for a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间暴风雪势头渐猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Storm grows with the passing hour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.61,0:29:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马军队无法进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}making Roman advance unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望有人讲话打扰她休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see her undisturbed by the gale of words as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.37,0:30:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在变成这样了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this how it is to be now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.79,0:30:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总是这样互相看不惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we always to find ourselves churning against one another,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.82,0:30:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟当年我们在巴蒂塔斯家做奴隶一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as when we were yet slaves to Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.71,0:30:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候你的胆子可没这么小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgotten days when you were yet of bolder mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们全军出动进攻克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we had moved with proper force against Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,结果又会怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would have been result?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,假设我们走了那条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Peer into future of path not taken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.68,0:30:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,说说看你认为会怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and break where you believe it to lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.12,0:30:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅就不会血洒当场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ground not stained with Naevia's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.77,0:30:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只怕有上千个弟兄要抛洒热血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see it but joined by thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会英勇战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would but fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.81,0:30:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,壕沟围墙还有什么战术可讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wall and trench block forward tactic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.30,0:30:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟克拉苏玩策略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your plot against Crassus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.98,0:30:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,已经证明了你没有他那么狡猾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have been bested by more devious mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.63,0:30:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该让所有人拿上武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should place sword in every hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.36,0:30:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一息尚存 就要跟罗马狗干到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet with strength to lift it and fall upon the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的四周是悬崖峭壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are bound by canyon walls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.88,0:30:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,侧翼包抄是行不通的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent hope of flanking maneuver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.79,0:30:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,面对兵力装备占优 军纪严明的罗马军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To face superior numbers possessed of armor and discipline{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能自寻死路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will gain us nothing but our own deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.32,0:31:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让罗马狗看看 我们如何视死如归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then let the Romans see how we fucking embrace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.35,0:31:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我们在沙场上学到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As we were taught to upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你又在说废话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You return to spent argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.43,0:31:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之中并没有多少角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Few among us stand as gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可不想壮烈赴死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They do not pray for a glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.61,0:31:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他们盼着有人带头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. They pray to be led.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.84,0:31:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会带着他们去送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not march my people to the afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我也绝不会让罗马狗从背后捅刀子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will not die with a Roman sword in my back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.79,0:31:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我去召集志同道合的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will gather those of a like mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,出兵迎战克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and press attack upon Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.96,0:31:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆敢违抗命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will fall to command{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真当自己是神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not a fucking God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.82,0:31:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会听凭你指手画脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I do not heed to voice upon high!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.00,0:32:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.41,0:32:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都他妈的疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you fallen from fucking reason?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.01,0:33:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这话还是问你的领袖吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A question better posed to your leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.39,0:33:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是争吵的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now is not time for quarrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大风已经吹翻了医护帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Medicus tent has been struck by rising winds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,暴雪将至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The storm approaches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.12,0:33:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,必须带他们到掩蔽处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See those exposed to shelter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.04,0:33:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神这是要在我们进攻之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Gods threaten to wipe clean the blight of rebellion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.22,0:33:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,先行扫清叛贼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before we're able to mount attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们明日一早就出兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we shall rise with morning sun,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.19,0:33:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把诸神赦免的叛贼清扫干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and finish any they have chosen to spare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.24,0:33:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像没听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not hear welcoming horns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎提比略及其军队前来的号角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}announcing Tiberius' approach with balance of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.73,0:33:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都没来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They stand as absent as his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.77,0:33:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该随军行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were to aid him in troops' movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.18,0:33:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我说得不够清楚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was command not clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.42,0:33:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我听得一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the air between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.73,0:33:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但有更紧急的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet pressing matter clouds thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.78,0:33:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能抗命前来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thunder sound toward higher duty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.37,0:33:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟敢带她来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would bring her here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.73,0:33:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来到战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon field of battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.11,0:34:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.65,0:34:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是我苦苦哀求恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar but bends to tearful plea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.55,0:34:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只因我心中哀痛 要一吐为快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From mournful tongue that must break word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.94,0:34:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.55,0:34:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.87,0:34:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何不遵守命令待在北门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you not wait at northern gate as ordered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.82,0:34:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我也舍不得离开你 可是有急事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Urgent task drew me from the pleasure of your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.08,0:34:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲要是知道你不服从命令 肯定不高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father will not stand pleased by word of insubordination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.21,0:34:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,换作我 现在就不去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would pause before seeking audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅正忙着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Imperator is otherwise taken...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.25,0:34:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,见他最心爱的奴隶呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by presence of beloved slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,克芮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.53,0:34:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你违反军令就是为了带女人来军营吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You disobey command to bring a fucking woman to encampment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.56,0:34:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她非常急切地要与你父亲谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was desperate to break word with your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.76,0:34:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在不忍心拒绝给她见面的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not find heart to deny her opportunity to gain his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.39,0:35:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她有何事如此急迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What concerns so move her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.52,0:35:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他们的秘密了 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, that's the mystery, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.48,0:35:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过别着急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet calm rattled nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.65,0:35:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你是父亲的好儿子 她说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm certain father will share with trusted son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.61,0:35:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲肯定会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all she reveals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.77,0:35:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,今天怎么总是有人违抗我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is my will to be defied at every turn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.77,0:35:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说了 等打完了仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I not tell you that wanted moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.33,0:35:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我自然会找你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would find you at battle's end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我来是坏了您的规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know my presence stands in violation of rule,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.46,0:35:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我迫不及待想要见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet I could not wait upon the hour to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.29,0:35:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喝了吧 暖和暖和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drink, see yourself warmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.95,0:35:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在暴雪肆虐 无法送你回希留爱沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Storm's fury stays hand in returning you to Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.79,0:35:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等势头减弱些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At first sign of its passing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.99,0:35:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒会亲自把你送到城内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar himself shall see you again to safety of city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.25,0:35:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等您回罗马时 我就留在那里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where I am to remain when you return to Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.95,0:35:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,被您永远地抛弃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forever banished from your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.21,0:35:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,抛弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Banished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.22,0:35:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.70,0:35:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,希留爱沙就是为你夺来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I claimed Sinuessa for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.41,0:36:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我要去见你的时候就有地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that we may have a place to ourselves when I am to visit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.33,0:36:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,随时可去 不受监视 避开闲言蜚语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}frequently, far from jealous eyes and wagging tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.33,0:36:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是惩罚 是礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not punishment, but gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.45,0:36:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你将受我名号的恩泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall rise as my name does,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.51,0:36:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,成为克拉苏家族在希留爱沙的女管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as vilica of the House of Crassus in Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.94,0:36:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,服侍提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beneath Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.73,0:36:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他会在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will be beside you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以陪伴他 以你的智慧指导他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}receiving benefit of your company and wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.68,0:36:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,像你对我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I so often have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.82,0:36:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他很看重你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know how much he cares for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.60,0:36:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你也关心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.72,0:36:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他从青涩懵懂的男孩变成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've helped move him from the boy he was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.87,0:36:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今日的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the man he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.75,0:36:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不出还有谁比你更适合辅佐他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can think of no one more suited to further guide him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.16,0:36:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,若是他达不到您的期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear the prospect of blame,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.67,0:36:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕您要怪罪于我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should you find him less than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.24,0:36:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strike worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.09,0:36:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这我们无从预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing beyond imagining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.93,0:37:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾经无药可救 令您大为失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has proved bitter disappointment in the past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.95,0:37:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略的确犯过大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is true that Tiberius fell to grievous error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.38,0:37:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我也曾怒发冲冠 暴跳如雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I to wrath threatening to shake the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我们父子同心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet we now stand as one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.75,0:37:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还知道 在我内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I know in deepest heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.99,0:37:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他毕竟是我心爱的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is no misstep that would see father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,无论犯下什么错 都是可以原谅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}withhold forgiveness from treasured son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.08,0:37:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为劝你两句 你便不会泪流满面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd hoped soothing words to stem tide of overflowing tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.85,0:37:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pay them no mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是以前那个傻丫头没流完的泪罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are but lingering shadows of a foolish girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.77,0:37:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,作为女人 你只用知道自己想要什么就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as the woman stands clear to heart's desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 马科斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.68,0:37:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我再清楚不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is very clear to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.25,0:38:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再来人我们就不用担心风雪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we take in any more our difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.84,0:38:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,该担心我们没空气可呼吸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may be lack of air to breathe, not cold or snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.98,0:38:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒宁愿挤在一起臭哄哄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prefer the pressing of rancid flesh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.73,0:39:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也不愿意老屌冻成冰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to having cock become as ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.57,0:39:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈的就不能摆脱这混蛋吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I never to be free of this fucking shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.91,0:39:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,同样摆脱不了咆哮的狂风和被吹跑的帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Add to storm's bluster and see tent blown from strained mooring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.90,0:39:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Castus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.38,0:39:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯要我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus commands me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Choice is removed from hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.20,0:39:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet not from mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.08,0:39:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要放了我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see me free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都是纳西尔的恳求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Action born of Nasir's plea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.10,0:39:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是他求情 我一刀子捅了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that absent them my blade would be slick with Cilician blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.23,0:39:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.26,0:39:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别露出这种表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not fucking cast that look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.71,0:39:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Gannicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.65,0:39:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他没和你在一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.11,0:39:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.62,0:40:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.91,0:40:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,以此鲜血…我们诚恳地…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With this blood... we humbly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.50,0:40:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恳请…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}entreat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.88,0:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没和其他人一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you not go with the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.36,0:40:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须向诸神献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must give offering...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.34,0:40:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会为我们指引道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the gods shall reveal path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.35,0:40:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你再这么跪下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They reveal only your death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.78,0:40:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,指引你走向死路还差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you remain on bended knee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.28,0:40:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找地方躲避风雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seek shelter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.24,0:40:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就等着到天上见你们的神吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or greet your gods upon the shores of the afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.59,0:40:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.64,0:41:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.53,0:41:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会走丢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would be lost as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯不会被风雪打败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus will not fall to wind and ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.82,0:41:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他体内的酒热着呢 会为他抵御寒冷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wine forever in his blood will keep him warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.79,0:41:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不喜欢寒冷的天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never favored the cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.71,0:41:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来毯子下面暖和暖和吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Share blanket, and see yourself warmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.75,0:41:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no need for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.71,0:41:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你都冻得牙齿打架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your teeth threaten to shake from head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.10,0:41:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.97,0:41:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你伤口疼了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wound gives pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,疼痛说明我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It reminds that I yet live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而我也想要活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And choose to continue to do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.84,0:42:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩又躲在这么狭小的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We again find ourself in pressing space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.09,0:42:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,疗伤 祈祷死亡别带走我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nursing wounds and praying the afterlife does not take us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.07,0:42:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你在祈祷吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pray now, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.79,0:42:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.38,0:42:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会傻到跪在风雪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I am not dim of mind to kneel in storm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.95,0:42:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,向上天放声乞求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}raise voice to the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.59,0:42:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,更不会放自己的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor spill my own blood as offering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.69,0:42:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It stood as sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.68,0:42:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.14,0:42:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在把他当成神了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe him a god now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.02,0:42:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是代他祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was made on his behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.21,0:43:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,恳求诸神眷顾他的大业 以及为之献身的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To plead for his cause and all those devoted to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.66,0:43:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾怀疑过你的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have doubted your belief in days past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.89,0:43:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是我太傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Found myself a fool for it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.18,0:43:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are safe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.23,0:43:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are safe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.76,0:43:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过你 远离我这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have warned you. To stay far from men of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.29,0:43:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ask the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.64,0:45:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.83,0:45:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.36,0:45:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,将近一千人在暴雪中丧生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nearly a thousand lost to the storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.21,0:45:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.54,0:45:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.77,0:45:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我还担心你也死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had feared you among the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.07,0:45:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神怜悯 让我们有地方躲过一劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods took pity, and provided us with needed shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.79,0:45:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,并非所有人都如此幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all so blessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.18,0:46:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,的确不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. They were not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.01,0:46:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们寻求上天的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We sought aid from the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,保佑我们远离壕沟与围墙的黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To see us beyond darkness of trench and wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.04,0:46:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是诸神的答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And here stands reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.03,0:46:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神虽残酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet in their cruelty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,却也为幸存者指了一条生路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perhaps the gods light way for those yet living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.51,0:46:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你丧失理智了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You turned from fucking reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经清醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have embraced it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.58,0:46:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要填平壕沟 发起进攻 正如你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall forge trench and press attack, as you so championed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.40,0:46:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我们还有那一千个兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we held yet another thousand men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.21,0:46:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如今他们都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now forever lost to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.21,0:46:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏的围墙外还有军队 我们怎么打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of the army that awaits beyond Crassus' wall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们众寡悬殊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will we match their number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.69,0:46:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也许没有那么悬殊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps there stands no need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.95,0:47:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你有话不直说 遮遮掩掩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak in fucking riddles, obscuring truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.01,0:47:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正如克拉苏处处遮掩他的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As Crassus obscures all he has done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.53,0:47:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,每一步都狡诈异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shrouding his moves in deception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.70,0:47:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,派来恺撒卧底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Placing Caesar among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.14,0:47:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,收买赫拉克里奥帮他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turning Heracleo to his cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.69,0:47:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吸引我们去他的军帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drawing us into trap within his tent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.02,0:47:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是玩阴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing is ever as it appears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.11,0:47:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那就说出你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then break fucking thoughts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.44,0:47:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就滚蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or fall from presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.47,0:47:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他的壕沟足够截断我们逃跑的路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His trench stands barrier enough to halt escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.59,0:47:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还要建一道高不可攀的围墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why see it coupled with impossible fortification?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.55,0:47:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看不见围墙后面有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To keep our eyes from what lies beyond it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.83,0:47:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,或者没有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or what does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.14,0:47:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只要派少数人上围墙便可施展疑兵之计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few man placed upon wall would give illusion of thousands beyond it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.35,0:47:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是那只老狐狸的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A deception worthy of the man himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.47,0:47:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,万一你错了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you are wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.63,0:47:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就光荣牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we shall embrace a glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.57,0:47:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,至少没让罗马人从背后捅死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent Roman swords in our backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.36,0:48:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你想的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your thoughts were true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.93,0:48:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只有几百人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stand only but a few hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.80,0:48:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那就用他们的热血温暖寒夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us warm the night with their blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.83,0:49:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,卢戈 布瑞克提斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lugo! Brictius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.47,0:50:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,带人给这道围墙开个口子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take men and see breach made in the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.22,0:50:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.09,0:50:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.76,0:50:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼突破了围墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebels have breached the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.82,0:50:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,传令军团集合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Command the legion to fall to formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.99,0:50:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.63,0:50:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的奴隶送回希留爱沙了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was my slave escorted back to Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.08,0:50:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没人离开您的大帐 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None left your tent, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.08,0:51:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.31,0:51:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上大部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and follow the others!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.69,0:51:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.40,0:51:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,四处搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check everywhere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.38,0:51:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她跑到叛贼的队伍里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has moved to join rebellion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.75,0:51:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要是没人送她来 她也没这个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An opportunity denied her, had she not been brought to the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.76,0:51:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我原以为她是为了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought her to have just cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.46,0:51:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.32,0:51:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,围墙上没有岗哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stands no sentry upon the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.15,0:51:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也没看到斯巴达克斯他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor sight of Spartacus and his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.79,0:51:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It holds no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.94,0:51:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎么跨过壕沟的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could he have spanned trench?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.67,0:52:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fucking savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.44,0:52:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他用死人把壕沟填平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fills trench with his own dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.30,0:52:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他也只有这一招了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He but seizes means left to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.12,0:52:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定没跑远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They can not have traveled far a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.71,0:52:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,传令军团前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give order to advance the legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.87,0:52:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要夺回我的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would reclaim what is mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.62,0:52:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,保护统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Protect the imperator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.98,0:52:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.27,0:52:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,破阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.02,0:52:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的克拉苏在我们面前屁滚尿流地跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mighty Crassus shows fucking ass as he flees from us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.87,0:53:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他会带着攻城锤和投石器回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will return, with rams and ballistae.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.68,0:53:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后发现他到手的功业灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And find his monument of illusion taken to flame,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.06,0:53:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们远远地甩开了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lending opportunity to place distance between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.87,0:53:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see ourselves far from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.88,0:53:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候用胜利和马科斯•克拉苏的鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And honor the fallen with future victories...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.76,0:53:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,祭奠我们的死者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the blood of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
